# Flutter Architecture Rules

Use Clean Architecture by feature.

Preferred structure:

```text
lib/
  app/
  core/
  shared/
  features/
    auth/
    timeclock/
    employee/
    manager/
    hr_admin/
```

Each feature should be split into:
- data
- domain
- presentation

Use Riverpod, go_router, Dio, Freezed/json_serializable, flutter_secure_storage and Material 3.

Never put API calls directly inside widgets.
Never put business logic in UI widgets.
